                                                                    String.format(
                                                                            "Invalid task specified. Cannot find task by name %s in the task definitions",
                                                                            workflowTask.getName());
                                                            return new TerminateWorkflowException(
                                                                    reason);
                                                        }));

        Map<String, Object> input =
                parametersUtils.getTaskInputV2(
